    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d275">

                <pb facs="0295" n="285" xml:id="pg285"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/3744</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Messersmith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9002</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-06">April 6,
                        1943</date>.<lb/>[Received April 10.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to previous correspondence
                    in connection with the proposed settlement of Polish refugees in Mexico, I have
                    the honor to transmit herewith a copy of a memorandum drawn up in the Embassy
                    following a meeting on April 5, at the Foreign Office which I attended and
                    during the course of which arrangements were made for representatives of the
                    Ministry for Foreign Affairs and of the Interior to communicate with the
                    Governor of Guanajuato with respect to the possibility of locating the refugees
                    in that State.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George S. Messersmith</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d275-a1.xml" xpointer="d275-a1"/>
            </div>
